---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<header class="relative pt-8 pb-32.5 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_75%_60%_at_50%_15%,_rgba(109,255,181,0.22),transparent_68%), linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff_0%,var(--color-paper-soft)_100%)] text-ink overflow-hidden group">

    <div class="absolute top-[-20%] right-[-8%] w-[55%] h-[130%] bg-linear-to-br from-mint to-teal opacity-[0.11] z-0 pointer-events-none animate-[heroPolygonFloat_10s_ease-in-out_infinite_alternate]" style="clip-path: polygon(32% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[5%] left-[8%] w-105 h-105 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,155,158,0.14)_0%,rgba(109,255,181,0.12)_50%,transparent_70%)] blur-[55px] z-0 pointer-events-none animate-[auraOrb_8s_ease-in-out_infinite_alternate]"></div>

    <div class="max-w-300 mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white border border-teal/25 text-teal-dark font-semibold text-[13.5px] tracking-[0.08em] px-5 py-2.25 rounded-full uppercase shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(0,155,158,0.08)] mb-7 relative">
            <span class="text-teal text-[10px] animate-[neonDotPulse_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]">●</span>
            Ale Moreno - Entrenador Personal
        </span>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0 lg:gap-16 items-center w-full">

            <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full order-2 lg:order-1 relative z-20 -mt-12 lg:mt-0">
                <h1 class="flex flex-col items-center text-center justify-center font-oswald text-[clamp(48px,6.5vw,72px)] font-bold leading-[0.95] -space-y-0.5 tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink uppercase mb-6.5 w-full">
                    <span class="whitespace-nowrap">Consigue tu</span>
                    <em class="not-italic text-gradient-pro skew-x-[-8deg] drop-shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(0,155,158,0.18)] whitespace-nowrap px-2">cambio físico</em>
                    <span class="whitespace-nowrap">con Ale Moreno</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="text-[clamp(16px,1.5vw,18px)] text-ink-soft max-w-120 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                    Entrenamiento personal a domicilio y online, adaptado a tu objetivo, salud o rendimiento. Sin fórmulas genéricas, con seguimiento real.
                </p>

                <a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-ink text-white px-9 py-4.5 rounded-full font-oswald font-bold text-[17px] uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[0_14px_34px_rgba(10,35,35,0.22),0_0_0_4px_rgba(0,155,158,0.1)] transition-all duration-250 hover:-translate-y-0.75 hover:scale-105 hover:bg-teal-dark hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(0,155,158,0.32),0_0_24px_rgba(109,255,181,0.35)] relative overflow-hidden group/btn w-auto">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w5 h-5"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.85.5 3.58 1.44 5.13L2 22l5.13-1.34a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.91 1.29c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2zm0 17.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.1-1.13l-.29-.17-3.05.8.81-2.97-.19-.3a7.9 7.9 0 0 1-1.21-4.22c0-4.38 3.56-7.94 7.94-7.94s7.94 3.56 7.94 7.94-3.56 7.94-7.94 7.94z"/></svg>
                    Comienza hoy
                    <div class="absolute top-[-50%] left-[-70%] w-[45%] h-[200%] bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-white/25 to-transparent rotate-25 pointer-events-none animate-[shimmerSweep_4.5s_cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)_infinite]"></div>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="mobile-image-mask relative w-full aspect-4/5 lg:h-125 max-w-105 lg:max-w-105 mx-auto lg:mx-0 lg-ml-auto order-1 lg:order-2 z-10 rounded-4xl lg:overflow-hidden lg:shadow-2xl lg:border-4 lg:border-white/50">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-paper-soft z-0"></div>
                <img src="/hero-logo.jpeg" alt="Alejandro Moreno Entrenador Personal" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top relative z-10 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-full mt-8">
            <p class="mb-0 text-[14px] text-ink-soft font-medium">
                Primera sesión de valoración sin coste - sin compromiso.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mt-9">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/88 border border-line backdrop-blur-[10px] px-4.5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(10,35,35,0.05)] transition-all duration-250 hover:-translate-y-0.75 hover:border-teal hover:shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(0,155,158,0.12)] group/badge">
                    <span class="text-teal inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4.75 h-4.75 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/badge:scale-[1.15] group-hover/badge:-rotate-6">
                        <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                    </span>
                    100% Planes a medida
                </div>

                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/88 border border-line backdrop-blur-[10px] px-4.5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(10,35,35,0.05)] transition-all duration-250 hover:-translate-y-0.75 hover:border-teal hover:shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(0,155,158,0.12)] group/badge">
                    <span class="text-teal inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4.75 h-4.75 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/badge:scale-[1.15] group-hover/badge:-rotate-6">
                        <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path></svg>
                    </span>
                    Desde 15 min · 3 veces/semana
                </div>

                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/88 border border-line backdrop-blur-[10px] px-4.5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(10,35,35,0.05)] transition-all duration-250 hover:-translate-y-0.75 hover:border-teal hover:shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(0,155,158,0.12)] group/badge">
                    <span class="text-teal inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4.75 h-4.75 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover/badge:scale-[1.15] group-hover/badge:-rotate-6">
                        <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
                    </span>
                    Modalidad Online y A Domicilio
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<div class="divider-pro"></div>

<style>
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
        .mobile-image-mask {
            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 50%, transparent 95%);
            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 50%, transparent 95%);
        }
    }
</style>